# Step 6 with its controls (a variant beside the ladder, P6.10): the three-way valve holds the
# mixed supply into the exchanger in place of its stated inlet.

fluidscript 1
circuit coolingLoop
fluid water

HE1 heat_exchanger power=30 out.t=50
TE1 t_sensor at NM
TC1 pid kp=2
3WV three_way_valve
PU1 pump

connections
N1 - N2
N2 - NM - PU1
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - 3WV
3WV - N2
3WV - N3 length=25 dn=25

N1 inlet t=6 p=300
N3 outlet p=280

control 3WV with TE1 by TC1 setpoint=20
